--- !u!114 &223026095
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 223026092}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: fcb4077a782b4f849b9e119dddf9484d, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  tutorialSteps:
  - messageText: You're a BEAN your goal is to get pollinated by bees
    requiredBlockCount: -1
    showNextButton: 1
    showArrow: 1
    arrowInWorldSpace: 1
    arrowRotation: 180
    arrowTargetPosition: {x: 0.005, y: 1.297, z: 0}
    arrowUIPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
    arrowShouldBounce: 0
    triggerType: 0
    componentsToEnable: []
    objectsToActivate: []
    designerNotes: Introduction
  - messageText: Click here to place WOOD blocks
    requiredBlockCount: -1
    showNextButton: 0
    showArrow: 1
    arrowInWorldSpace: 1
    arrowRotation: 5
    arrowTargetPosition: {x: 0, y: 1.297, z: 0}
    arrowUIPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
    arrowShouldBounce: 1
    triggerType: 1
    componentsToEnable: []
    objectsToActivate: []
    designerNotes: First stem placement - arrow needs positioning. Player can also
      click Next to skip.
  - messageText: Click the WOOD button and 2 WOOD blocks
    requiredBlockCount: -1
    showNextButton: 1
    showArrow: 1
    arrowInWorldSpace: 1
    arrowRotation: 180
    arrowTargetPosition: {x: 0.005, y: 1.297, z: 0}
    arrowUIPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
    arrowShouldBounce: 1
    triggerType: 1
    componentsToEnable: []
    objectsToActivate: []
    designerNotes: Wait for stem count to increase
  - messageText: Try clicking in between two blocks to insert
    requiredBlockCount: -1
    showNextButton: 1
    showArrow: 1
    arrowInWorldSpace: 1
    arrowRotation: 90
    arrowTargetPosition: {x: 1, y: 1.5, z: 0}
    arrowUIPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
    arrowShouldBounce: 0
    triggerType: 1
    componentsToEnable: []
    objectsToActivate: []
    designerNotes: Teaches insertion mechanic
  - messageText: Click and hold to add lots of blocks, grow branches
    requiredBlockCount: -1
    showNextButton: 1
    showArrow: 0
    arrowInWorldSpace: 0
    arrowRotation: 0
    arrowTargetPosition: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    arrowUIPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
    arrowShouldBounce: 0
    triggerType: 1
    componentsToEnable: []
    objectsToActivate: []
    designerNotes: Wait for 3 blocks to be added
  - messageText: You can cut off a branch with triple right click.
    requiredBlockCount: -1
    showNextButton: 1
    showArrow: 1
    arrowInWorldSpace: 1
    arrowRotation: 270
    arrowTargetPosition: {x: 0, y: 3, z: 0}
    arrowUIPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
    arrowShouldBounce: 0
    triggerType: 2
    componentsToEnable: []
    objectsToActivate: []
    designerNotes: Must delete a block to advance
  - messageText: A single right click will tell you what's about to get removed
    requiredBlockCount: -1
    showNextButton: 1
    showArrow: 0
    arrowInWorldSpace: 1
    arrowRotation: 0
    arrowTargetPosition: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    arrowUIPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
    arrowShouldBounce: 0
    triggerType: 0
    componentsToEnable: []
    objectsToActivate: []
    designerNotes: Camera controls - moved to end so arrows stay in correct position
  - messageText: Deleting works for FLOWERS and LEAVES too
    requiredBlockCount: -1
    showNextButton: 1
    showArrow: 0
    arrowInWorldSpace: 1
    arrowRotation: 0
    arrowTargetPosition: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    arrowUIPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
    arrowShouldBounce: 0
    triggerType: 0
    componentsToEnable: []
    objectsToActivate: []
    designerNotes: Camera controls - moved to end so arrows stay in correct position
  - messageText: Good. Now try switching to LEAF
    requiredBlockCount: -1
    showNextButton: 1
    showArrow: 0
    arrowInWorldSpace: 0
    arrowRotation: 0
    arrowTargetPosition: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    arrowUIPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
    arrowShouldBounce: 1
    triggerType: 3
    componentsToEnable: []
    objectsToActivate: []
    designerNotes: Arrow should point to Leaf UI button
  - messageText: LEAVES like fresh WOOD blocks to grow from
    requiredBlockCount: -1
    showNextButton: 1
    showArrow: 0
    arrowInWorldSpace: 0
    arrowRotation: 0
    arrowTargetPosition: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    arrowUIPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
    arrowShouldBounce: 0
    triggerType: 0
    componentsToEnable: []
    objectsToActivate: []
    designerNotes: Info about leaf requirements
  - messageText: Add some LEAF blocks to your plant
    requiredBlockCount: -1
    showNextButton: 1
    showArrow: 0
    arrowInWorldSpace: 0
    arrowRotation: 0
    arrowTargetPosition: {x: 1, y: 2, z: 0}
    arrowUIPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
    arrowShouldBounce: 0
    triggerType: 1
    componentsToEnable: []
    objectsToActivate: []
    designerNotes: Wait for 2 leaves - may need special handling for sequential arrows
  - messageText: Add some LEAVES to the plant. They produce food. When your food
      runs out blocks will start to fall
    requiredBlockCount: -1
    showNextButton: 1
    showArrow: 0
    arrowInWorldSpace: 0
    arrowRotation: 180
    arrowTargetPosition: {x: -5, y: 4, z: 0}
    arrowUIPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
    arrowShouldBounce: 0
    triggerType: 0
    componentsToEnable: []
    objectsToActivate: []
    designerNotes: Arrow should point to food counter
  - messageText: A LEAF can support about 5 blocks
    requiredBlockCount: -1
    showNextButton: 1
    showArrow: 0
    arrowInWorldSpace: 0
    arrowRotation: 0
    arrowTargetPosition: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    arrowUIPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
    arrowShouldBounce: 0
    triggerType: 0
    componentsToEnable: []
    objectsToActivate: []
    designerNotes: Info dump
  - messageText: Each block has an upkeep cost. You can see it affecting your food
      in the top left
    requiredBlockCount: -1
    showNextButton: 1
    showArrow: 0
    arrowInWorldSpace: 0
    arrowRotation: 0
    arrowTargetPosition: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    arrowUIPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
    arrowShouldBounce: 0
    triggerType: 0
    componentsToEnable:
    - {fileID: 1150882049}
    objectsToActivate:
    - {fileID: 1004517372}
    designerNotes: Info dump
  - messageText: Keep an eye on your food. Is it going up or down?
    requiredBlockCount: -1
    showNextButton: 1
    showArrow: 0
    arrowInWorldSpace: 0
    arrowRotation: 180
    arrowTargetPosition: {x: -5, y: 4, z: 0}
    arrowUIPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
    arrowShouldBounce: 0
    triggerType: 0
    componentsToEnable: []
    objectsToActivate: []
    designerNotes: Point to food indicator
  - messageText: LEAVES need light to make food. They are inactive in shade
    requiredBlockCount: -1
    showNextButton: 1
    showArrow: 0
    arrowInWorldSpace: 0
    arrowRotation: 0
    arrowTargetPosition: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    arrowUIPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
    arrowShouldBounce: 0
    triggerType: 0
    componentsToEnable: []
    objectsToActivate: []
    designerNotes: Should trigger transparency animation - see TutorialManager.HandleSpecialStepSetup
  - messageText: A LEAF must be in the sun to produce food, it will make a sound
      each time it produces
    requiredBlockCount: -1
    showNextButton: 1
    showArrow: 0
    arrowInWorldSpace: 0
    arrowRotation: 270
    arrowTargetPosition: {x: 0, y: 1, z: 0}
    arrowUIPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
    arrowShouldBounce: 0
    triggerType: 0
    componentsToEnable: []
    objectsToActivate: []
    designerNotes: Should spawn shaded leaf - see TutorialManager.HandleSpecialStepSetup
  - messageText: Try removing any inactive LEAVES
    requiredBlockCount: -1
    showNextButton: 1
    showArrow: 0
    arrowInWorldSpace: 0
    arrowRotation: 270
    arrowTargetPosition: {x: 0, y: 1, z: 0}
    arrowUIPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
    arrowShouldBounce: 0
    triggerType: 2
    componentsToEnable: []
    objectsToActivate: []
    designerNotes: Must delete the shaded leaf
  - messageText: Hold right click and drag to move the camera or scroll to zoom
    requiredBlockCount: -1
    showNextButton: 1
    showArrow: 0
    arrowInWorldSpace: 1
    arrowRotation: 0
    arrowTargetPosition: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    arrowUIPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
    arrowShouldBounce: 0
    triggerType: 0
    componentsToEnable: []
    objectsToActivate: []
    designerNotes: Camera controls - moved to end so arrows stay in correct position
  - messageText: FLOWERS are very expensive but let's make one. The number in the
      top right is how many pollinations left until you reach the goal.
    requiredBlockCount: -1
    showNextButton: 1
    showArrow: 0
    arrowInWorldSpace: 0
    arrowRotation: 0
    arrowTargetPosition: {x: 5, y: 0, z: 0}
    arrowUIPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
    arrowShouldBounce: 0
    triggerType: 0
    componentsToEnable: []
    objectsToActivate: []
    designerNotes: Arrow should point to Flower UI button
  - messageText: To win you need bees to vist your FLOWERS
    requiredBlockCount: -1
    showNextButton: 1
    showArrow: 0
    arrowInWorldSpace: 1
    arrowRotation: 0
    arrowTargetPosition: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    arrowUIPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
    arrowShouldBounce: 0
    triggerType: 0
    componentsToEnable: []
    objectsToActivate: []
    designerNotes: Camera controls - moved to end so arrows stay in correct position
  - messageText: FLOWERS continue to grow after you place them
    requiredBlockCount: -1
    showNextButton: 1
    showArrow: 0
    arrowInWorldSpace: 0
    arrowRotation: 0
    arrowTargetPosition: {x: 5, y: 0, z: 0}
    arrowUIPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
    arrowShouldBounce: 0
    triggerType: 1
    componentsToEnable: []
    objectsToActivate: []
    designerNotes: Wait for flower placement
  - messageText: Hopefully the bees will visit soon
    requiredBlockCount: -1
    showNextButton: 1
    showArrow: 0
    arrowInWorldSpace: 0
    arrowRotation: 0
    arrowTargetPosition: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    arrowUIPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
    arrowShouldBounce: 0
    triggerType: 0
    componentsToEnable: []
    objectsToActivate: []
    designerNotes: Info about bees - can increase spawn rate here
  - messageText: Middle mouse wheel to zoom in and out. Good Luck
    requiredBlockCount: -1
    showNextButton: 1
    showArrow: 0
    arrowInWorldSpace: 1
    arrowRotation: 0
    arrowTargetPosition: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    arrowUIPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
    arrowShouldBounce: 0
    triggerType: 0
    componentsToEnable:
    - {fileID: 698691997}
    objectsToActivate:
    - {fileID: 2130677116}
    - {fileID: 1190700512}
    designerNotes: Camera controls - moved to end so arrows stay in correct position
  - messageText: More flowers will attract more bees. Resources are more generous
      in the tuorial
    requiredBlockCount: -1
    showNextButton: 1
    showArrow: 0
    arrowInWorldSpace: 0
    arrowRotation: 0
    arrowTargetPosition: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    arrowUIPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
    arrowShouldBounce: 0
    triggerType: 5
    componentsToEnable: []
    objectsToActivate: []
    designerNotes: Tutorial ends when bee visits - loads next level
  tutorialUI: {fileID: 223026094}
  showDebugLogs: 1
