  instructions: '1. Play the game

    2. Advance to the step you want to position

    3.
    PAUSE the game (not stop!)

    4. Move WorldArrow in scene to desired position

    5.
    Rotate WorldArrow to desired angle

    6. Click ''Save Current Arrow Position''
    button below

    7. Continue to next step and repeat'
